-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data shipped with RAGbase Shield
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/ragbase_shield/engine/lexicon/first_names_fr.txt
  Derived from: INSEE, "Fichier des prénoms", édition 2025 (births in France
  1900-2025), national file, https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/8595130
  Licence: Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab),
  https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/
  Changes made by RAGbase: names folded (lower case, accents removed), totals
  summed over sexes and years, names with fewer than 150 births or fewer than
  3 letters removed, birth counts dropped. Rebuilt with
  bench/tools/build_first_names.py.
  Source: INSEE, Fichier des prénoms, édition 2025.

src/ragbase_shield/engine/lexicon/en_first_names.txt
  Derived from: US Census Bureau, "Frequently Occurring First Names and
  Surnames From the 1990 Census" (dist.female.first, dist.male.first),
  https://www2.census.gov/topics/genealogy/1990surnames/
  Licence: US government work, public domain.
  Changes made by RAGbase: names folded, a sex column added (F/M/U from the
  two files), short and rare names removed, a hand-written supplement of
  modern and international first names and of nickname pairs added, a few
  entries removed by the evaluation audit. The header of the file documents
  the derivation.

Every other lexicon file under src/ragbase_shield/engine/lexicon/ (stop
words, vocabulary, places, acronyms, legal forms, legal terms, whitelists,
NER stop lists, synthetic name, street and town lists) was written for
RAGbase Shield.

